[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

A hedgehog is a quill covered creature that can be killed for [[Raw Hedgehog]] and [[Hedgehog Quills]]. It takes up a 2x2 space in the inventory when alive. They are found on [[Forest]] terrain.

Note that picking up and butchering Hedgehogs will give your character Quill'd [[wounds]], unless your character is wearing gloves. 

==Quick Facts==

* Seems to be consistently found in [[Root Bosk]] and [[Timber Land]] biomes.
* Desperate Hearthling who lost their battle for sanity can build up Quill'd wound incredibly fast by repeatedly picking and releasing single hedgehog.

==Trivia==

* Hedgehogs were added in the update {{Patch|Sonic Youth}}, but of the few encounters reported by players there were next to no evidence.
* As of the update {{Patch|Thy Kingdom Come}} it seems to spawn more often and on diffrent terrains (?).

